<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8"/>
  <title>404 | Tracer Study</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background: #f0fdf4; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 100vh; }
    .wrap { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; }
    .code { font-size: 8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0d9488; line-height: 1; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #1e293b; margin: 1rem 0 .5rem; }
    p { color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
    a { background: #0d9488; color: #fff; padding: .75rem 2rem; border-radius: .75rem; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
    a:hover { background: #0f766e; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>Halaman tidak ditemukan</h1>
    <p>URL yang Anda akses tidak tersedia.</p>
    <a href="/">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
